WEBVTT - WorkOS Auth (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:09.942
Customers expect to sign in with their company identity. Building single sign-on yourself takes months.

2
00:00:11.042 --> 00:00:17.742
WorkOS Auth adds WorkOS sign-in to the TYPO3 frontend and backend.

3
00:00:18.992 --> 00:00:25.979
New customers create an account with a password, an email code, Google or Microsoft.

4
00:00:27.029 --> 00:00:33.677
Editors use the same identity in the backend. The classic form stays one click away.

5
00:00:34.727 --> 00:00:40.878
The setup assistant lists every redirect URI, each with a copy button.

6
00:00:42.178 --> 00:00:45.221
WorkOS Auth for TYPO3.
